flowchart LR
    UI[Admin UI] --> Auth[Firebase Auth role claims]
    UI --> Lite[AdminReadRepository: one-time reads]
    Lite --> FS[Firestore]
    UI --> RC[Remote Config: operational flags]
    UI --> Live[Appointment listeners]
